      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AVENGEMENT (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (34.35) at The Meadows behind Amron Toy in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Makes plenty of appeal. AYDEN'S WARRIOR (7) had won three in a row before finishing second (34.37) last time at this track. Has never been out of the money in nine starts this course. Expected to feature. ACCREDITED (3) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 6 lengths at Traralgon in a handy 33.06. Has a low draw and has a good record over this journey. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. PAW LOVISA (4) will be hard to beat with a drop in journey.",
